## Changelog

### v3 — 17 Nov 2026
- Added a progress log (CSV), suggested resume point, and batch size option.
- Esc is now checked several times per email, and prompts are forced to the front.
- `SHOW_EACH_EMAIL` now defaults to `False`.
- Removed the pre-Office 2010 fallback declaration (it showed as a red line on 64-bit Office).

### v2 — 17 Nov 2026
- Press Esc to stop; progress shown in the status bar; `ResetMailMergeSettings` repair macro added.

### v1.1 — 17 Nov 2026
- Error handling and clean-up; original mail merge settings restored after a run.
- Fixed: a second Subject column wiped out other errors.
- Removed the leading `;` from address lists; error drafts now set the body directly.
- Past delivery times reported as errors; yes/no values read the same way for all columns.
- Several attachments per cell; count of included records; warning if Outlook wasn't open; end-of-run summary.

### v1.0 — 4 May 2026
- Initial release.

